  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant is awarded to the DanChurchAid project Responding to the Syrian Crisis: A multisectoral approach to providing essential, life-saving support to communities impacted by the Syrian conflict.

The stated objective of the project is: Enable conflict-affected people and communities to meet their basic needs and live in safe and dignified conditions, enabling the building back of personal and local resilience.</narrative>
